= Faculty
The academic staff of the Wireless Networks and Optimization Group

The group is led by Assoc. Prof. Phuong Luu Vo and includes the following faculty members.
We supervise PhD, Master, and undergraduate students jointly, so feel free to contact the
person whose interests best match yours.

~~~
{Faculty members}{table}{faculty}
*Name* | *Position* | *Research area* | *Contact* ||
Phuong Luu Vo | Associate Professor (group leader) | Resource allocation, stochastic optimization, learning-based network control | [phuong.luuvo@example.edu] ||
Le Minh Duc | Senior Lecturer | Network economics, energy-efficient communications | [duc.le@example.edu] ||
Pham Thu Ha | Lecturer | Signal processing for large antenna arrays, RIS | [ha.pham@example.edu] ||
Hoang Quoc Bao | Lecturer | Queueing theory, performance analysis of 5G/6G systems | [bao.hoang@example.edu] ||
~~~

